## Per-node EVM flags.

## Listen on loopback for the distribution protocol in single-node mode.
## Phase 6 clustering swaps this.
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9100 inet_dist_listen_max 9200

## Enable observer/remsh later without restarting the release.
-setcookie ${RELEASE_COOKIE}

## Reasonable defaults for a BPMN engine: many lightweight GenServers.
+K true
+A 64
+P 262144
+S 2:2
